graph TD
   A[CSV uploaded to Blob Storage] --> B[Blob trigger run.ps1]
   B --> C[Write blob to temp input.csv]
   C --> D[Call guest-delete.ps1]

   D --> E[Connect to Microsoft Graph with certificate]
   D --> F[Read CSV rows: UPN and RUNID]
   E --> G[Evaluate each guest account]
   F --> G

   G --> H{State and inactivity rules}
   H -->|Match cleanup criteria| I[Delete guest account]
   H -->|No match| J[Keep account]

   I --> K[Create result row]
   J --> K
   K --> L[Export PendingInvite-Results.csv]

   L --> M[Upload result to output-logs]
   L --> N[Archive input blob]

   O[Managed Identity or Az login] --> M
   O --> N
